    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers Ltd are delighted to present to the market this three-bedroom, end-terrace house situated in this highly sought after development in Baldoyle within walking distance to the Dart. The spacious & bright accommodation comprises of a porch, entrance hall, lounge with feature fireplace and kitchen/dining area with sliding doors to a private rear garden. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms and a large, family bathroom. There is a garden to the front with off street parking and a private, landscaped West facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe location couldn't be more convenient with all local amenities on your doorstep including the Coastal walks to Sutton and Portmarnock, excellent public transport including bus & DART services nearby ensuring fast access to the City Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Tiled floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall      4.06 x 1.77 Decorative timber floor, under stairs storage, coat rack\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room     5.20 x 3.26 Decorative timber floor, storage closet, fully-fitted kitchen, fridge freezer, oven, hob, extractor, dishwasher, sliding door to rear garden\r\n\r\nLounge 3.33 x 4.28 Timber floor, feature open fireplace, light fitting, arch to dining room/lounge\r\n\r\nStairs/Landing Hot press, carpet floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 3.13 x 2.93 Carpet floor, fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 4.12 x 3.31 Fitted wardrobe, carpet floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 2.70 x 2.00 Carpet floor, fitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.02 x 2.08 Tiled floor& tongue and groove panelled walls, w.c, w.h.b, heated rail, walk-in shower\r\n\r\nRear Garden Fully walled, boiler, paved, private hedge, selection of shrubs and plants"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tCLOSE TO ALL NECESSARY AMENITIES    \r\n•\tOFF STREET PARKING AND PRIVATE REAR GARDEN\r\n•\tEND OF TERRACE \r\n•\tPOPULAR LOCATION IN BALDOYLE VILLAGE \r\n•\tRE-WIRED IN NOVEMBER 2021\r\n•\tNEW BATHROOM IN 2024& NEW OIL BOILER IN 2023\r\n•\tOVERLOOKING A GREEN AREA  \r\n•\tOIL CENTRAL HEATING"
      },
